; CK_GOLD_DTREND - GFT 5K 2-step, XAUUSD CFD, min lot 0.01, STATIC-DD firm.
; GOAL = generate the MOST profit while respecting the rules (10% static from initial, 5% daily).
; H4 long-only gold trend + D1 trend-confirm + ADX regime stand-down. Never shorts. Auto sits out chop.
; Attach on XAUUSD H1 chart. Deposit 5000 USD.
;
; DEFAULT = BALANCED sizing (risk 2.5% / cap 5% = a single trade can't break the 5% daily rule):
;   Backtest (Model-1, MetaQuotes-Demo XAUUSD ~1yr, gold ~3300->5000):
;   FULL yr +55% PF2.16 (39 tr); trend leg +82% PF5.19; MAY-SEP chop -1.1%; STATIC DD from initial ~0.4% (balance-abs 0).
;   NOTE: Model-4 real-tick is ~30% lower (expect ~+38% real). High returns lean on a trend arriving to build a buffer.
;
; RISK SPECTRUM (change InpRiskPercent + InpMaxRiskPerTradePct):
;   SAFE     : 1.0 / 3.0  -> ~+16-25% (M1), per-trade <=3%, smoothest.
;   BALANCED : 2.5 / 5.0  -> ~+55% (M1), per-trade <=5% (daily-rule safe).   <-- default
;   AGGRESSIVE: 3.0 / 8.0 -> ~+74% (M1) BUT per-trade up to 8% can breach the 5% DAILY rule on a bad trade.
; Other tweaks: InpUseHTFtrend=false -> more profit in trend but chop bleeds; InpSigTF=16385 -> H1 (~109 tr/yr, more active).
InpMagic=20260930
InpSigTF=16388
InpEngine=0
InpFastEMA=20
InpSlowEMA=100
InpKAMA_ER=10
InpKAMA_Fast=2
InpKAMA_Slow=30
InpUseRegime=true
InpRegimeTF=16388
InpRegimeADXPeriod=14
InpADXTrendMin=20.0
InpUseHTFtrend=true
InpHTFtrendTF=16408
InpHTFtrendEMA=50
InpUseChop=false
InpChopTF=16388
InpChopPeriod=14
InpChopMax=61.8
InpATRPeriod=14
InpSL_ATR=2.0
InpUseTrailATR=true
InpTrailATR=3.0
InpRiskPercent=2.5
InpMaxLot=0.50
InpMaxRiskPerTradePct=5.0
InpCapStopToRisk=true
InpMaxSpreadPrice=1.00
InpUseDailyLoss=true
InpDailyLossPct=5.0
InpUseStaticDD=true
InpStaticDDStopPct=9.0
